                "description": "The Octagon Lever with Matching Rose is a great addition to historic homes. This cast bronze door leverset has a unique shape that is sure to catch eyes. Choose from either Flat Black Bronze or Medium Bronze finishes. The Octagon Lever with Matching #15 Octagon Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n",
